---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site title="About — GridZero" description="Free, open-source Sudoku. No ads, accounts, or tracking." linkWordmark>
  <main id="main" class="document">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Free, open-source Sudoku. No ads. No tracking. No accounts.</p>
    <p>Play from the collection of 8,000 puzzles or generate puzzles on your device. Your progress stays in this browser.</p>
    <h2>Offline play</h2>
    <p>Visit once online and let the game load before going offline. You can also add GridZero to your Home Screen.</p>
    <p>On iPhone or iPad, open GridZero in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. On Android, choose Install app or Add to Home screen from the browser menu.</p>
    <p>Browser storage is not a backup. Clearing site data, storage eviction, or private browsing may remove saves or caches.</p>
    <p><a href="/support/">How to play</a> · <a href="/credits/">Puzzle credits</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></p>
  </main>
</Site>
